{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13212090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13212090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1321209001:1":{"text":"안녕하세요! 혹시 작은 눈사람이 뛰어가는 걸 보지 못하셨나요?","source_cn":"您好！请问您看到有个小雪人跑过去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB252F7BAD08D4DC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1321209002:1":{"text":"뛰어다니는 눈사람? 내 앞에 있는 이 눈사람들 말하는 거야?\n내가 만든 거야! 엄청 열심히 만들었다고!","source_cn":"什么会跑的雪人？你问前面这堆？\\n——我堆的！费了我好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x645B0E2E0E5EFC42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321209003:1":{"text":"이렇게 많은 눈사람을 만들어서 뭐 하시려고요?","source_cn":"你在这里堆这么多雪人做什么呀？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x311C027F9E85429F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321209004:1":{"text":"봐, 그림의 배경이잖아.","source_cn":"喏，这不是画画的布景嘛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2DD9E135E0106D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321209005:1":{"text":"나의 우상... 아르테카 님께서 마침 시더 마을에 스케치를 하러 오셨거든.","source_cn":"我的偶像——大师阿托卡——刚好来雪松镇写生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC28921A0B97E6B77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321209006:1":{"text":"스케치요?","source_cn":"写生？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C0EDCC3F788730C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321209007:1":{"text":"어라, 모르는 거야? 시더 마을엔 굉장히 유명한 꽃바다가 있는데, 대부분의 장인들이 찾아오는 이유기도 하지.","source_cn":"你们不知道？雪松镇有片花海，很出名的，大师就是为此慕名而来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61DD6023055A4FAE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321209008:1":{"text":"난 말이야, 만족스러운 작품을 하나 그려서 내 우상과 소통하고 싶어.","source_cn":"我呢，想好好画一张满意的作品，然后带去和偶像交流。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA499E16E4CB083D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321209009:1":{"text":"어쩌면... 장인에게 지도를 받을 수 있을지도 모르잖아?!","source_cn":"说不定……还能得到大师的指导呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC90BD4D46D3DD23E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321209010:1":{"text":"음? 왜 아직도 여기 있는 거야? 난 이제 그림을 그려야 한다구.","source_cn":"嗯？你们怎么还在这里？我要开始画画了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A7A3F787727037C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321209011:1":{"text":"마스터, 제 생각엔 그 작은 눈사람이 이 안에 숨어있는 것 같아요.","source_cn":"主人，我觉得那个小雪人，绝对藏在这里面。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5496EE6064B4F8D5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터, 제 생각엔 그 작은 눈사람이 이 안에 숨어있는 것 같아요.","female":"마스터, 제 생각엔 그 작은 눈사람이 이 안에 숨어있는 것 같아요.","variant_male_record_index":"146698","variant_female_record_index":"146699","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321209012:1":{"text":"거참! 화가 선생님이 우리더러 가라고 한 것 못 들었어?","source_cn":"哎呀！你没听出来这画家在送客吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4694B3E4683F6422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1321209012":{"text":"거참! 화가 선생님이 우리더러 가라고 한 것 못 들었어?","source_cn":"哎呀！你没听出来这画家在送客吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4694B3E4683F6422","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321209013:1":{"text":"아... 더 많아야 할까요...","source_cn":"啊……更多些，会更好看吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF65D438AA286E184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321209014:1":{"text":"하지만 눈사람을 만드는 데는 시간이 걸리는데...","source_cn":"可是……堆雪人很花费时间啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3A9DEF0A3363403","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321209017:1":{"text":"아... 갑자기 눈사람을 만들고 싶어지네요~","source_cn":"哎呀……突然有点想堆雪人了呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF88D17CDCA9E64C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321209018:1":{"text":"이럴 때 갑자기 웬 눈사람이야... 발은 또 왜 밟아!","source_cn":"这个时候了怎么突然想堆雪人……你踩我干嘛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06FE54199BEB88BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321209019:1":{"text":"아... 아! 그래! 눈사람이 만들고 싶어지네~","source_cn":"哦……哦！对！好想堆雪人啊~","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD54113B00D951090","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321209020:1":{"text":"저기, 아니면... 나 대신 눈사람 좀 만들어 줄래?","source_cn":"那个，你们要不……帮我堆点雪人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27A1858A02B0F58C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321209021:1":{"text":"그러면 그림 그리는 데에 집중할 수 있고... 어쩌면 더 빨리 완성할 수 있을지도 모르고!","source_cn":"我这样就可以专心画画了……也许能快点完成！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9372F6DAD876401D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1321209022:1":{"text":"역시 마스터에요! 이렇게 하면 눈사람을 확인해 볼 수 있겠어요.","source_cn":"不愧是主人！这样就可以趁机检查雪人了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x53A0D644846084CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"역시 마스터에요! 이렇게 하면 눈사람을 확인해 볼 수 있겠어요.","female":"역시 마스터에요! 이렇게 하면 눈사람을 확인해 볼 수 있겠어요.","variant_male_record_index":"146710","variant_female_record_index":"146711","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"눈사람이 많으면 더 아름다울 텐데","source_cn":"雪人再多点就更好看了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7E2804CB8F6530EA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"눈사람이 많으면 더 아름다울 텐데","female":"눈사람이 많으면 더 아름다울 텐데","variant_male_record_index":"69080","variant_female_record_index":"69081","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1321209015:1":{"text":"벌써 녹는다고요? 아직 며칠 그리지도 않았는데!","source_cn":"又化了？我还没画几天呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6649BB571B858C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1321209016:1":{"text":"눈사람 만드는 건 시간이 너무 오래 걸리는데...","source_cn":"堆雪人太浪费时间了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04D950110BE6642A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"아이고~ 눈사람이 녹으려고 하네","source_cn":"哎呀~怎么有些雪人要化了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA3B77E675355A94D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아이고~ 눈사람이 녹으려고 하네","female":"아이고~ 눈사람이 녹으려고 하네","variant_male_record_index":"69082","variant_female_record_index":"69083","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:画家派特":{"text":"화가 파이트","source":"画家派特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":26,"localized_text_count":25,"speaker_count":3}}